title: The states of a server

text cbb6776cd982
<h1>The states of a server</h1>
<p>A server is a follower, a candidate, or the leader.</p>

diagram 3e8988a142b1
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Follower
  Follower --> Candidate: times out
  Candidate --> Leader: wins the vote
  Candidate --> Follower: hears a leader
  Leader --> Follower: hears a higher term

text b72d0525e36c
<p>The text after a diagram opens a new block. The source of a diagram is
kept as the agent typed it, <code>&lt;</code> and <code>&amp;</code> included: Mermaid escapes it.</p>

